silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_05_philosophical_substrate_concrete_anchor_3#mittensforgefactorizationsquare silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensForgeFactorizationSquare is In section 'Philosophical Substrate of the Forge' the bare symbol TraceWitness anchors to MittensForgeFactorizationSquare: The commutative square: manifest hom-profile (top edge) equals trace fingerprint (bottom edge) under the forge factorization; if it fails to commute, the source is rejected at admission." .
